%% UC-09 — Enroll in study (redeem or skip study code)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (studyEnrollRouter)
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Enter study code (or skip)
    alt redeem code
        F->>B: POST /api/v1/enroll/redeem-code {code}
        B->>M: findOne(study_codes, {code})
        M-->>B: code {studyId, groupId, maxRedemptions, expiresAt}
        B->>B: Validate not expired / not exhausted
        B->>M: insert(enrollments {userId, studyId, groupId}), $inc redemptionCount
        B-->>F: 200 enrolled in study group
    else skip code
        F->>B: POST /api/v1/enroll/skip-code
        B->>M: Resolve default study (isDefault: true), insert enrollment
        B-->>F: 200 enrolled in default study
    end
